 "result": "I documented 10 repos this run. Eight had new commits: the Agent Test Bed, Road Layers, Field Twin, Field Twin Violet, Hire Portal, Pajamastan, Rainbow Run and Stompbox Lab. Two were backfills: the badge tool and its backend, stinkin-badges. Each got one scribe commit, and the profile page and the control-troll state were pushed too.\n\nNo more app backfills remain. control-troll, heckle-troll and sudosilo have no state entry, and I skipped them on purpose because they are agent and profile repos.\n\nA few other repos had only scribe or bot commits, so I just refreshed their pushed times. The ten new release and settings jobs are in `scribe/publish.json` for the publish workflow to carry out. I did not run that workflow or check its result.\n\nI could reach every repo I tried. The two repos I deliberately skipped earlier (mission-operator and free-as-in-links) are archived, so their docs can't be updated. Neither had new commits this run. stinkin-badges has no live page (404), so its homepage is empty.\n\nI added one new line to `agents/notes/general.md`. That file is now 44 lines, over the 40 line limit, and I did not condense it this run.",
